+.IP TypeLibrary()
+.IP env.TypeLibrary()
+Builds a Windows type library (\fB.tlb\fP)
+file from an input IDL file (\fB.idl\fP).
+In addition, it will build the associated inteface stub and
+proxy source files,
+naming them according to the base name of the \fB.idl\fP file.
