+This function is deprecated.  For details, see the entry for the
+.B SourceCode
+function.
+
+Example:
+
+.ES
+env.SourceCode('.', env.SCCS())
+.EE
+.IP
+Note that
+.B scons
+will fetch source files
+from SCCS subdirectories automatically,
+so configuring SCCS
+as demonstrated in the above example
